OL,3,GNEWSAGPs call for urgent boost to
OL,4,Ahealth fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FGPs in Jersey have called for an
OL,7,F"urgent injection of funding" into the
OL,8,Fpot of money that makes doctors'
OL,9,Fappointments cheaper and prescriptions
OL,10,Ffree.
OL,12,FDr Maitiu O Tuathail said a long-term
OL,13,Fplan was also needed to avoid facing a
OL,14,F"cliff edge" by 2030.
OL,16,FIn its proposed budget, Jersey's
OL,17,Fgovernment stated that the Health
OL,18,FInsurance Fund (HIF) would be
OL,19,F"exhausted during the early-2030s
OL,20,Funless action is taken".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
